log             log.MOF5-P1 append
units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p

pair_style      lj/cut 12.500
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     hybrid fourier cosine/periodic
dihedral_style  harmonic
improper_style  fourier

dielectric      1.0
special_bonds   lj/coul 0.0 0.0 1.0
pair_modify     tail yes mix arithmetic
box tilt        large
read_data       data.MOF5-P1

#### Atom Groupings ####
group           fram     id   1:424
#### END Atom Groupings ####

